// Broadside cannons — AOE cone damage. AbilityId 2 (alphabetical:
// Board < Cannons). Dispatched by FireCannons physics rule.
//
// `damage X in cone(range, half_angle_deg)` lowers via the cone arm
// in `cg/emit/wgsl_body.rs::emit_aoe_dispatch_branch`. The dispatcher
// walks the 27-cell neighborhood around the cast center, gates each
// candidate by (range² ∧ angular gate), and writes one
// EffectDamageApplied chronicle record per kept candidate.
//
// Cone exercises the second-most-tested AOE shape (after Circle/Spread).
// Range 8.0 + 90° half-angle = wide forward broadside.

ability Cannons {
    target: enemy
    range: 8.0
    cooldown: 3
    hint: damage

    damage 6.0 in cone(8.0, 90.0) [PHYSICAL: 100]
}
